  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Running Dinosaur Automaton. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files of the Running Dinosaur Automaton and obtain detailed information, please visit the Running Dinosaur Automaton on MakerWorld."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Notes"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Please note that this Running Dinosaur Automaton is powered via USB and conveniently connects to your computer or other USB powered device. You also have the option of purchasing a USB Speed Controller to adjust the speed at which the dinosaur runs as needed."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Running Dinosaur Automaton</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">model files</strong> and <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\" style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"></div>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\"><!-- 表头 --></table>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">To download the model files of the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Running Dinosaur Automaton</strong></span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> and obtain detailed information, please visit the </span><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Running Dinosaur Automaton</strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> on </span><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/422534?from=search#profileId-325850\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><u data-mce-fragment=\"1\">MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">.</span></div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">In the Box</h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 95px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\"><span>1. Self-Locking Button Switch with SH1.0 Connector - IA006</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Self-Locking Button Switch with SH1.0 Connector<span> (2PCS)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Wire Pair with SH1.0<span> (2PCS)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<p>2. N20 Single Shaft Worm Gear Motor 25rpm - LA008</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<ul>\n<li>N20 Single Shaft Worm Gear Motor<span> (1PCS)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Wire Pair with SH1.0<span> (1PCS)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment